{"title":"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to estimate the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643e1765342cf3807fd7d130ee679b71ecd4789b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are real numbers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/8763b276b45bcaa9d42bb9c7638fdd70404e7f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />, Xiaoli rounded <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> up by a small amount, rounded <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> down by the same amount, and then subtracted her rounded values. Which of the following statements is necessarily correct?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/80263c9727a3313b9757cad1aa4f051e716da923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\text{Her estimate is larger than } x - y \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\text{Her estimate is smaller than } x - y \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\text{Her estimate equals } x - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"858\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c323d6eaa39b8a25414bcdb537aa4c585bba4c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) } \\text{Her estimate equals } y - x \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{Her estimate is } 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"417\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The original expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643e1765342cf3807fd7d130ee679b71ecd4789b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> now becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b637b7523f8257baa9aab83732cd4c0ef38b0e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+k) - (y-k)=(x-y)+2k&gt;x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive constant, hence the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem never says what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are, so we can decide what they are. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecb6b1b9639abdd194379f913db54e1f7b42599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/7169788010376cee623e99ab34002e6131405a77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />. We round <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Then the new <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba7450e47cb42313a97fb2f0d7788c4f32b65b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, while the original <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/9309bf1d83471a1f861fdc7b7034c11332e7c7ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y = 0.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" />. Thus, the new <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5c0a0f370ccf9702de26c839b7bffb5f9be88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is greater than the original <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5c0a0f370ccf9702de26c839b7bffb5f9be88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />. ~Extremelysupercooldude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B\">2012 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a